ACCEPTANCE CHECK

- The image shows exactly one complete, compact, solid runic barricade that
  reads as an active defensive obstacle at a gate.
- Its dark masonry, restrained gold/brass reinforcement, and blue-cyan runes
  follow the attached card's visual finish without reproducing its scenery or
  composition.
- The barrier is immediately distinct from the Fortress Shield dome: it is a
  physical stone structure, not a membrane or bubble.
- The complete silhouette is visible, level on a stable lower baseline, and
  surrounded by genuine transparent pixels with at least 64 px of safety
  margin.
- The image contains no environment, characters, gameplay UI, health state,
  or additional spell effects.
